You know, you put repellent on, the mosquitoes come along, they grab you, they take you down to the lake,

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
they wash you off and then they sting you-

11
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Yeah, that's how big they are. And then they smack you in the head and take your wallet.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Oh yeah, You don't want to go up there in mosquitoes.

13
